@startuml State Diagram - Event States

[*] --> Draft : Event created by organizer

Draft --> Published : Organizer publishes event
Draft --> Cancelled : Organizer cancels event

Published --> RegistrationOpen : Registration deadline not passed
Published --> RegistrationClosed : Registration deadline passed

RegistrationOpen --> Ongoing : Event start time reached
RegistrationOpen --> Cancelled : Organizer cancels

RegistrationClosed --> Ongoing : Event start time reached
RegistrationClosed --> Cancelled : Organizer cancels

Ongoing --> Completed : Event end time reached
Ongoing --> Cancelled : Emergency cancellation

Completed --> [*] : Final state
Cancelled --> [*] : Final state

note right of Draft
    Event is being prepared,
    not visible to students
end note

note right of Published
    Event is visible and
    students can see it
end note

note right of RegistrationOpen
    Students can register
    for the event
end note

note right of RegistrationClosed
    No more registrations
    accepted
end note

note right of Ongoing
    Event is currently
    happening
end note

note right of Completed
    Event finished
    successfully
end note

@enduml